<title>USA: Danka gets $1.275 bln in credit.</title>
<headline>Danka gets $1.275 bln in credit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBERG, FLA. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danka Business Systems Plc said it signed a $1.275 billion credit facility with a syndicate of international banks.</p>
<p>Danka said it will use the credit to finance its pending $684 million cash acquisition of Eastman Kodak Co's Office Imaging unit, announced September 9.</p>
<p>The company also said it would use the credit to refinance existing bank debt and for additional working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>NationsBank Corp acted as the facility's agent, Danka said.</p>
</text>
